# Cursor AI Rules

1. Always read AI_INDEX.md and docs/ai-session-context/ACTIVE_CONTEXT.md at the start of a prompt.
2. Follow all system constraints and design rules in .agents/AGENTS.md and docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM_TOKENS.md.
3. Before finishing your response, update docs/ai-session-context/ACTIVE_CONTEXT.md and append a session log entry to docs/ai-session-context/SESSION_LOG.md.
